Package: cz-battery-saver
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: InstantComet <10364622+InstantComet@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Depends: python3, python3-pil, pulseaudio-utils, fonts-dejavu-core, systemd, udev
Homepage: https://github.com/InstantComet/cz-battery-saver
Description: Longer battery life for the M5Stack CardputerZero
 Lets the internal USB Ethernet chip autosuspend (the whole USB bus then
 sleeps, ~105 mA), parks the launcher's audio stream and pauses the launcher
 while the screen is off (~70 mA), and shuts down cleanly at low battery.
 Runs as the desktop user, not root. Includes the Battery Saver launcher app
 for changing the settings on the device.
